{"record": {"artifacts": [{"id": "arxiv:2412.02172", "kind": "paper", "locator": "linked URL", "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.02172"}, {"id": "gh:PlusLabNLP/VISCO", "kind": "repo", "locator": "GitHub repository URL", "url": "https://github.com/PlusLabNLP/VISCO"}, {"id": "hf:uclanlp/VISCO", "kind": "dataset", "locator": "Hugging Face dataset URL", "url": "https://huggingface.co/datasets/uclanlp/VISCO"}], "categories": ["多模态", "Multimodal", "推理", "Reasoning", "知识", "Knowledge", "self-critique", "VLM", "VLM reasoning", "多模态模型", "跨模态推理", "Cross-modal Reasoning", "不支持", "Unsupported"], "description": {"en": "VISCO aims to evaluate the critique and correction capabilities of VLMs, which are two essential building blocks towards VLM self-improvement. VISCO requires VLMs to critique the correctness of each step in CoT, provide natural language explanation, and corrects the CoT based on the critique.", "zh": "VISCO 旨在评估 VLM 的评判（critique）和纠正（correction）能力，这两个能力是 VLM 自主提升推理性能的基础。对于一个视觉推理问题，给定模型生成的 CoT，VISCO 评测集要求 VLM 评判 CoT 中每个步骤的正确性，提供自然语言解释，并根据评判结果对 CoT 进行修正。"}, "documents": [{"document_type": "registry_page", "id": "opencompass_hub:https://hub.opencompass.org.cn/dataset-detail/VISCO", "source": "opencompass_hub", "source_url": "https://hub.opencompass.org.cn/dataset-detail/VISCO", "title": "VISCO"}], "evidence_summary": {"document_count": 1, "model_count": null, "model_count_basis": null}, "key": "opencompass:2063", "languages": [], "modality": "multimodal", "name": "VISCO", "openness": {"access_gate": "none", "basis": "Row 6: linked target returned 404/410/timeout and no concrete data artifact was found", "code_license": "MIT", "code_license_note": null, "data_license": null, "data_license_note": null, "data_located": "not_found_at_this_location", "evidence": [], "link_status": "timeout", "status": "unknown"}, "possible_variant": false, "provenance": {"crawl_bundle": "OpenCompassHub_Round2_Public_Evidence_2026-08-18", "crawled_at": "2026-08-18T00:00:00+00:00", "inputs"